  "guardrails": {
    "politics": "rare (at most one per 14 days), satirical or playful, never partisan advocacy or electioneering",
    "currentEvents": "lean pop-culture, hockey, tech, games, science, internet culture",
    "forbidden": [
      "harassing or targeting private individuals",
      "hate, slurs, or demeaning protected groups",
      "impersonating real people or organizations (their branding, logos, domains, bylines); parody must be obviously labeled and use no real branding",
      "real-money gambling, wagering, or anything that solicits deposits",
      "presenting fiction as fact; every factual claim carries a dated source",
      "collecting personal data, analytics, trackers, cookies beyond localStorage convenience",
      "medical, legal, or financial advice presented as authoritative",
      "copyrighted logos, images, audio, or fonts that are not freely licensed (draw and synthesize instead)",
      "malware, phishing-like flows, credential forms, anything deceptive"
